{"data": [{"author_id": "1655213511772114955", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:16:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116881995666251877"], "id": "2116881995666251877", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "sketch-world: Turn a drawing into a walkable, animated 3D paper pop-up world. Built with Meta Muse Spark, SAM 3.1 and Muse Image on Cloudflare Workers.\nhttps://t.co/dhzSrYMMDy\n\n#hackathon #meta #musecode #OpenSource\nhttps://t.co/TC7JCO6hcQ", "url": "https://x.com/xd_decagon/status/2116881995666251877"}, {"author_id": "2115438173232742400", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:56:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116876917626294473"], "id": "2116876917626294473", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tried Meta Muse \u2014 personal AI chat, not a clipping tool.\n\nJoin https://t.co/l254OIQ89w then redeem Z7G0K5 in Settings within 48h (both sides get 1B Muse tokens).", "url": "https://x.com/LoveaiOps/status/2116876917626294473"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116860685158133761"]}, "author_id": "1443195228165447680", "created_at": "2026-11-01T11:51:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116860700291203472"], "id": "2116860700291203472", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse Charm Versus a $50 Devkit\n\nMeta plans to sell a Muse Charm AI companion this holiday season. \n\nThe Verge senior editor Sean Hollister built a similar device for $50. \n\nHe used the Waveshare ESP32-S3 1.75C devkit with a 1.75 inch touchscreen. \n\nThe kit is officially https://t.co/PblR9nYsjG", "url": "https://x.com/ApollonVisual/status/2116860700291203472"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116819654119395328"]}, "author_id": "1452600677713072139", "created_at": "2026-11-01T09:08:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116819665796436350"], "id": "2116819665796436350", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 76, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hey @Meta @Muse, My Muse account was hacked, and when I tried to restore it, I have been facing this error for the past three days. When I try to create a new password and verify my email address, I still get this error response. Please help me recover my Muse account. https://t.co/PQC2ZNfXb6", "url": "https://x.com/talktopixel_/status/2116819665796436350"}, {"author_id": "1465364103199920128", "created_at": "2026-11-01T08:51:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116815391280468008"], "id": "2116815391280468008", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I gave a crew of AI agents my family photos and one sentence: \"a film of my daughter growing up.\"\n\nIt wrote it, cut it, watched its own draft, took notes and re-cut it. Then it picked the better cut blind.\n\nBuilt in 10 days on Meta Muse. #MetaAIHackathon\nhttps://t.co/QEb7l7vRaQ", "url": "https://x.com/agmondp/status/2116815391280468008"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116720411975012352"]}, "author_id": "1866291779491835904", "created_at": "2026-11-01T02:34:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116720549543936101"], "id": "2116720549543936101", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta, a founding partner of Future Forum London 2026, held in King's Cross from October 13-15, welcomed 1,500 attendees over three days. More than 500 guests tried Meta products hands-on, including the newly launched Meta Ray-Ban Display and others like Oaklye Meta, Muse, and https://t.co/7Jua3ps2MS", "url": "https://x.com/LightSciencXXII/status/2116720549543936101"}, {"author_id": "2116669598221115392", "created_at": "2026-11-01T00:03:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116682449266549096"], "id": "2116682449266549096", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Five people in my family took my grandmother to appointments. Nobody could say who confirmed her meds.\n\nI built Pendia to fix that \u2014 doctors' letters become a shared plan the family actually follows, powered by Meta Muse Spark.\n\nDemo \ud83d\udc47\nhttps://t.co/Aq2iPUKS9H", "url": "https://x.com/EcoNestSystems/status/2116682449266549096"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116662728983265280"]}, "author_id": "17858256", "created_at": "2026-10-31T22:45:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116662961913938141"], "id": "2116662961913938141", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 193, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "bob (my @meta muse AI) rebuilt my MMA tracking spreadsheet today; automated everything for me.\nI told him he did a good job and he did a happy dance \ud83e\udd23 https://t.co/fl55pRBGhR", "url": "https://x.com/nakiannu/status/2116662961913938141"}, {"author_id": "2098878501235388422", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:13:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116609521300971520"], "id": "2116609521300971520", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 105, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I built Edited!, an AI agent that turns long videos into shorts.\nIt finds the hook, crops to 9:16, and adds animated subtitles. Built on Meta Muse.\nFree live demo, no signup needed:\nhttps://t.co/3Doa4SfyR1\nOpen source: https://t.co/THBdqspQvc\n#MetaAIHackathon #BuildInPublic #AI", "url": "https://x.com/frmtradedrm/status/2116609521300971520"}, {"author_id": "2083135617907466240", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:06:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116607709416153540"], "id": "2116607709416153540", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I built Edited!, an AI agent that turns long videos into shorts.\nIt finds the hook, crops to 9:16, and adds animated subtitles. Built on Meta Muse.\nFree live demo, no signup needed:\nhttps://t.co/Lbc6htPucm\nOpen source: https://t.co/4NHZ5o1XAJ\n#MetaAIHackathon #BuildInPublic #AI", "url": "https://x.com/leofromtradedrm/status/2116607709416153540"}, {"author_id": "14352948", "created_at": "2026-10-31T18:56:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116605255911940521"], "id": "2116605255911940521", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 57, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "https://t.co/rsTAQuVM9v\nWordUp! Scroll - The Scroll The Word Web App is now complete. Built in partnership with #Logo, my @Meta @Muse AI Transformation Agent in the WordUpCafe! #WordUp!  Totally FREE! No account. No tracking. Scroll. Listen. Study. Share. Runs on your device.", "url": "https://x.com/denmarjo/status/2116605255911940521"}, {"author_id": "1814720239147622401", "created_at": "2026-10-31T18:51:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116603977303568524"], "id": "2116603977303568524", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Can you explain it back?\n\nMeet ExplainBack: turn a question or sketch into an interactive lesson.\n\nPredict. Explore. Explain. Then try a new case\u2014in English or \u4e2d\u6587.\n\nBuilt with Meta Muse + SAM 3.1.\nAI drafts; people review.\n\nhttps://t.co/dKvfSm6rvv\u2060\n\n#MetaMillionAIHackathon", "url": "https://x.com/TheOneQuote_SPW/status/2116603977303568524"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116550961657499650"]}, "author_id": "1952035225976057856", "created_at": "2026-10-31T15:49:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116558080418979934"], "id": "2116558080418979934", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "When a 130kW liquid-cooled GPU rack ruptures a hose, conductive fluid reaches the 48V busbar in under 60 seconds.\n\nBuilt CryoGuard AI: physics-bounded leak defense, 6-stage hardware isolation, and post-mortem RCA with Meta Muse Spark Open.\n@baseten \n@cerebral_valley\n@AIatMeta https://t.co/XtLzIK7wTx", "url": "https://x.com/Divyanshu00014/status/2116558080418979934"}, {"author_id": "138143310", "created_at": "2026-10-31T15:32:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116553896692769107"], "id": "2116553896692769107", "in_reply_to_user_id": "138143310", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 109, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113317986635485559", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2116553642706677905", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Shared Meta Muse pages could be found by people who were never sent the link\n\nMuse is Meta's AI assistant, launched in the US on September 8. When a user asks it to share something, Muse makes a web page that anyone with the link can open without logging in. Security firm Claroc https://t.co/xop63AmBXl", "url": "https://x.com/abel_aguzmans/status/2116553896692769107"}, {"article": {"title": "I Tested Every Bot Platform So You Did Not Have To. Here Is What I Found."}, "author_id": "101584084", "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:06:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116532267581608050"], "id": "2116532267581608050", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 151, "impression_count": 40504, "like_count": 102, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 17}, "text": "https://t.co/5qrz3rNotk", "url": "https://x.com/BrianRoemmele/status/2116532267581608050"}, {"article": {"title": 